        "Closed the feedback loop through diminished flux in the glucokinase reaction",
        "Used sulfonylureas and the neonatal diabetes / hyperinsulinism mutations as evidence the mechanism is real",
        "Stated that glucagon's primary target is the LIVER and that it does not act on muscle",
        "Gave fructose 2,6-bisphosphate as one metabolite switching glycolysis off and gluconeogenesis on",
        "Compared the three fuel reserves by size and by how long each lasts",
